eams to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Sassy Cartoon Carnage</strong> \u2013 Fast-paced action meets bold, cheeky characters\u2014grumpy carrots, smug celery, and bread with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Survive the Madness</strong> \u2013 25 waves. Tiny map. Tons of enemies. Weak? Run for your life. Strong? Crush \u2018em all. Prove bread beats veggies every time.</p>","developers":["DaniDangerStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455040/13841f28fce9408cc74be39567e2155bd6c3a272/header.jpg?t=1760447280","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3455040/2004866159/976b36e7179d9db999dbc08f97c23191c2b1d800/1750852801/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747828382","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3455040/2004866159/976b36e7179d9db999dbc08f97c23191c2b1d800/1750852801/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747828382","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3455040/2004866159/976b36e7179d9db999dbc08f97c23191c2b1d800/1750852801/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747828382","id":257101381,"name":"Bread & Butter Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101381/92d372f4b2aa1d40e21b6b694100c50d59bba1c9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747828382"}],"name":"Bread & Butter","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Bread & Butter - $3.99 USD","packageid":1220840,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":399}],"title":"Buy Bread & Butter"}],"packages":[1220840],"pc_requi